        <item>
            <title>0.14.84</title>
            <pubDate>Sat, 27 Jun 2026 11:19:24 +0100</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>145</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.14.84</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.2</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<ul>
<li>Ghost screen-video card: bigger subtitle with tighter leading, the title and subtitle cling together with more room before the button, and the video icon is a real header-style button that also requests Screen Recording.</li>
<li>Filtered out Whisper subtitle-watermark hallucinations on near-silent audio: &quot;Subtitles by the Amara.org community&quot; (and every language variant, via the amaraorg fragment) plus non-speech captions like [Music], [Applause], and ♪ no longer leak into transcripts.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
